abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline and interactive visualization for lunar
  crustal magnetic field data from NASA PDS (Lunar Prospector
  and SELENE/Kaguya), with a systematic review of hypomagnetic
  field effects on terrestrial biology. Provides risk assessment
  for biological systems at candidate lunar landing sites.
